WEBVTT

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:02.900
Four AI assistants agreed
on the top three.

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:05.980
Then the budget prompt
changed the shortlist.

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:09.160
In Recoscope’s November fourth
dog food snapshot,

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:13.120
all four comparative answers ranked
Purina Pro Plan first,

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:16.440
Hill’s Science Diet second,
and Royal Canin third.

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:20.400
But ask for everyday dog food
under seventy dollars per bag,

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:21.920
and visibility changes.

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:26.060
IAMS and Purina ONE appeared
in all four budget answers.

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:27.780
Pro Plan appeared in two.

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:32.220
Overall, Pro Plan appeared in
ten of twelve usable answers.

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:34.180
A brand can lead the rankings

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:36.500
without appearing in every
budget answer.

00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:39.300
For brand owners, track
overall mentions,

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:42.260
budget visibility, and
comparative rank separately.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:45.560
These are captured mentions,
not verified prices

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:48.120
or evidence of diet
quality or safety.

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:51.400
Explore benchmark at getrecoscope.com.
